. If the target is an artifact or similar item, you automatically fail.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"dispel-magic","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 spell effect or unattended magic item"},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"KXA4aTJsnqPtCvNZ","heightenedLevel":3},"counteraction":true},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.9HpwDN4MYQJnW0LG","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"EHAo6Led04HBlVSc"},{"folder":"T8AzYUgNIAgTJ9Iz","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/mending.webp","name":"Mending","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You repair the target item. You restore 5 Hit Points per spell rank to the target, potentially removing the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{Broken} condition if this repairs it past the item's Broken Threshold. You can't replace lost pieces or repair an object that's been completely destroyed.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> You can target a non-magical object of 1 Bulk or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target a non-magical object of 2 Bulk or less, or a magical object of 1 Bulk or less.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"mending","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"non-magical object of light Bulk or less"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"10 minutes"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"KXA4aTJsnqPtCvNZ","heightenedLevel":3},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"2":{"target":{"value":"non-magical object of 1 Bulk or less"}},"3":{"target":{"value":"non-magical object of 2 Bulk or less, or a magical object of 1 Bulk or less"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.dINQzhqGmIsqGMUY","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"9IBcJ0zzrRaEK3kU"},{"folder":"lPzcDrjGDFbzuF2r","img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-weapon-polearm-ice-blue.webp","name":"Telekinetic Maneuver","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>With a rush of telekinetic power, you move a foe or something they carry. You can attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Dt6B1slsBy8ipJu9]{Disarm}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.7blmbDrQFNfdT731]{Shove}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.lOE4yjUnETTdaf2T]{Reposition}, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.ge56Lu1xXVFYUnLP]{Trip} the target using a spell attack roll instead of an Athletics check.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"telekinetic-maneuver","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["attack","concentrate","force","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"KXA4aTJsnqPtCvNZ","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.mrDi3v933gsmnw25","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"VLChzUtoO1Mn29IT"},{"folder":"D7UVaOiB40wTR6kv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/daze.webp","name":"Daze","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You push into the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals 1d6 mental damage, with a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"daze","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","manipulate","mental","nonlethal"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 round","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"1d6","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"mental"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":true,"statistic":"will"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"KXA4aTJsnqPtCvNZ"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"1d6"},"interval":2,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.4gBIw4IDrSfFHik4","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"EWYvBPnuiTMaWpHm"},{"folder":"D7UVaOiB40wTR6kv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/mage-hand.webp","name":"Telekinetic Hand","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create a floating, magical hand, either invisible or ghostlike, that grasps the target object and levitates it slowly up to 20 feet in any direction. When you Sustain the spell, you can move the object an additional 20 feet. If the object is in the air when the spell ends, the object falls.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 2 or less.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"telekinetic-hand","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 unattended object of light Bulk or less"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":true},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"KXA4aTJsnqPtCvNZ"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"3":{"target":{"value":"1 unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less"}},"5":{"range":{"value":"60 feet"}},"7":{"target":{"value":"1 unattended object with a Bulk of 2 or less"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.pwzdSlJgYqN7bs2w","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"kYlLhoIytHvgwflH"},{"folder":"D7UVaOiB40wTR6kv","img":"icons/skills/ranged/bullets-triple-ball-yellow.webp","name":"Telekinetic Projectile","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You hurl a loose, unattended object that is within range and that has 1 Bulk or less at the target. Make a spell attack roll against the target. If you hit, you deal 2d6 bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing damage—as appropriate for the object you hurled. No specific traits or magic properties of the hurled item affect the attack or the damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You deal double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You deal full damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"telekinetic-projectile","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["attack","cantrip","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"2d6","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"untyped"}},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"KXA4aTJsnqPtCvNZ"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"1d6"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"},"overlays":{"2I469pfbYcmFvzOA":{"_id":"2I469pfbYcmFvzOA","name":"Telekinetic Projectile (Bludgeoning)","overlayType":"override","sort":1,"system":{"damage":{"0":{"category":null,"type":"bludgeoning"}}}},"cUFX7ExSLeoa3vIF":{"_id":"cUFX7ExSLeoa3vIF","name":"Telekinetic Projectile (Piercing)","overlayType":"override","sort":2,"system":{"damage":{"0":{"category":null,"type":"piercing"}}}},"zFWsMjoeCnLxqJaV":{"_id":"zFWsMjoeCnLxqJaV","name":"Telekinetic Projectile (Slashing)","overlayType":"override","sort":3,"system":{"damage":{"0":{"category":null,"type":"slashing"}}}}}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.60sgbuMWN0268dB7","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"6zYRJJJdlinHnlWt"},{"type":"melee","name":"Beak","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["agile","finesse","magical","unarmed"]},"damageRolls":{"rnFfnWOcDxXSOADU":{"damage":"2d6+4","damageType":"piercing","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":15},"attackEffects":{"value":[]}},"_id":"GvysdscviXRlcmTY","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Spare Parts","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["magical","range-increment-30"]},"damageRolls":{"PJbl3JUCFISLGA1t":{"damage":"2d6+4","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":15},"attackEffects":{"value":[]}},"_id":"5I4hjtaYBrGb7vRa","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Sneak Attack","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The scupa deals 2d4 extra precision damage to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} creatures. If the creature became off-guard due to Analyze Armor, they instead deal 2d8 extra precision damage.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":""},"rules":[{"category":"precision","diceNumber":2,"dieSize":"d4","key":"DamageDice","predicate":["target:condition:off-guard"],"selector":"strike-damage"},{"key":"RollOption","label":"PF2E.SpecificRule.TOTMToggle.OffGuard","option":"target:condition:off-guard","toggleable":"totm"},{"selectors":["strike-damage"],"key":"DamageAlteration","mode":"override","property":"dice-faces","value":8,"predicate":["dice:slug:sneak-attack","analyze-armor"]}],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"sneak-attack","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"deathNote":false},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.AWvNPE4U0kEJSL1T","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"x3G41GChDVO0GPMw"},{"type":"action","name":"Analyze Armor","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The scupa carefully surveys the defenses of a creature they can see within 60 feet, searching for weak points. If the creature is benefiting from an item bonus to AC, such as from armor, bands of force, or mystic armor, the scupa can attempt a Crafting check to find a weakness in that defense. The DC of the Crafting check is equal to the standard DC for an item of that level or spell of that rank. If the creature is not benefiting from an item bonus, the Crafting check automatically fails.</p><hr /><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} against the scupa's attacks for 1 round.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> No effect.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The scupa can't attempt to Analyze Armor on the same target again for 24 hours.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"analyze-armor","toggleable":true}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"GvrrNZXB4oKGXpjf","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Display Tailfeathers","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The scupa fans out their tailfeathers, creating fascinating patterns. Each non-scupa creature within 30 feet must attempt a @Check[will|dc:19] save. The effects of Display Tailfeathers last for 1 round, but if the scupa uses this ability again on subsequent rounds, they extend the duration by 1 round for any creature already affected.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and is immune to Display Tailfeathers for 24 hours.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AdPVz7rbaVSRxHFg]{Fascinated} by the scupa.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, plus the creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled}.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","divine","mental","visual"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"nhpn6zM19uBXgd1v","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Invisible Hands","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>When a scupa casts @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.pwzdSlJgYqN7bs2w], they generate a pair of hands. This pair of hands has all of the typical properties of a single <em>telekinetic hand</em>, except that when the hands are in the scupa's square or an adjacent square, the scupa can use the hands to perform manipulate actions.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"Z4m5jZb19WGmNWQk","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}}],"effects":[],"sort":3000000,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.8.0"}}